    "body": "@reillyeon Oh cool cool thanks for the reply.\r\nI'm trying to draw a link between devices, aka which devices have been near to other devices. However, I'm not able to correlate the IDs with devices as I can't get the central device's ID.\r\nThere're some forums that suggested using devices' names but I don't think that's a reliable way to go about this",
