    "created_at": "2023-10-09T17:42:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-10-09T17:42:03Z",
    "body": "So far, allowing tracking of the user's device is out of scope for any of these APIs. A potential API to make the device discoverable (e.g. send advertisements) would also open the door for an API to retrieve information about the central. ",
